#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#            ESA Debris Risk Assessment and Mitigation Analysis Tool          
#            Cross Section of Complex Bodies
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#                               DRAMA - CROC
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Note:  "croc.inp" specifies the user settings for the CROC software.      
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
#=============================================================================
#
#-----------------------------< Basic Settings >------------------------------
# Run identifier (max. 6 characters)
#
  croc  
#
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Comments lines; do not use characters: ;!
#
  DRAMA
  CROC - Cross-section of Complex Bodies
#
   1   Functionality switch
#                           1 - F1. User defined Aspect Angle
#                           2 - F2. User defined Aspect Angle and Rotation Axis
#                           3 - F3. Randomly Tumbling satellite
#
   30.00  -(deg)- Aspect Angle Theta - only valid with F1. and F2.
   45.00  -(deg)- Aspect Angle Phi - only valid with F1. and F2.
   90.00  -(deg)- Rotation Axis Theta - only valid with F2.
   135.00  -(deg)- Rotation Axis Phi - only valid with F2.
#---eof-------------------------------------------------------------------eof---
